PATH OF SOLDIERS

The Order of Soldiers (OOS) is one of the oldest professional organisations
in our country. It dates back to times before mankind's banishment. In the
last centuries, the Order has become the main police force. We protect our
citizens from criminals and monsters. We believe in honorable fights, and al-
though we accept the use of fire-arms or magic, we prefer melee combat style.

The Order's hierarchy is very straightforward compared to other orders (which
apparently can't decide for one clear path and for clear responsibilities re-
garding orders and promotions). OOS ranks are listed in the following table:

RANK                   POWERS          CURRENTLY RESPONSIBLE FOR PROMOTIONS:

Soldier        S.      Turbulence      -
Centurio       Ct.     Hard Attack     Princeps Ania (Lost Outpost)
Hastatus       H.      Vortex          Princeps Jonas (XYZ)
Princeps       Pr.     Speedrun        Pilus Georgias (Lost Outpost)
Pilus          Pi.     Maelstrom       Primus Pilus Antonius (Outskirts)
Primus Pilus   PPi.    Steady State    Grandmaster Olsen (Temple of Enoa)
Grandmaster    GMs.    ?               -
